{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15930","headline":"赠王侍御 · 王建","name":"赠王侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚者昧邪正，贵将平道行。\n君子抱仁义，不惧天地倾。\n三受主人辟，方出咸阳城。\n迟疑匪自崇，将显求贤名。\n自来掌军书，无不尽臣诚。\n何必操白刃，始致海内平。\n恭事四海人，甚於敬公卿。\n有恶如己辱，闻善如已荣。\n或人居饥寒，进退陈中情。\n彻晏听苦辛，坐卧身不宁。\n以心应所求，尽家犹爲轻。\n衣食有亲疎，但恐踰礼经。\n我今愿求益，讵敢爲友生。\n幸君扬素风，永作来者程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}